  "title": "产区行 ～ 巴西～202407 ～记录2～采收与处理",
  "source_url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/5LqDXCOHPi65TYOX0I4npw",
  "publish_time": 1722304704,
  "status": "body_recovered",
  "extraction_method": "cached_body_fragment",
  "body_text": "有一些内容需要配合小视频可以感受的更直观一些，也第一次用了视频号上传一些视频，没有做啥后期和字幕，大家有啥理解不到位的问题可以评论区留言，我会回复或者集中的问题我会整理集合一个文章再解答哈～\n因为每一篇文章只能插入10个小视频，所以全部内容会拆分成几篇\n这次巴西行的内容涉及的的产区，庄园农场合作社和科研机构如下：\n// Fazenda Guariroba\nMinas Gerais - Campo das Vertentes - San Antonio do Amparo\n// Fazenda Santa Clara\nMinas Gerais - Campo das Vertentes\n- San Antonio do Amparo\n// Coopervass -\nFazenda Pilar\nMinas Gerais - Mantiqueira -\nNatércia\n// Expocacer - Fazenda Nunes\nCerrado - Mineiro -\nPatrocínio\n// Fazenda Minamihara\nSão Paulo - Alta Mogiana - Franca\n// UFLA - Universidad Federal de Lavras\nMinas Gerais -\nCampo das Vertentes -\nLavras\n//采收\n上次来只看到了采收机本机，都没看到地里动着的；这回可算看够了，到哪都能看到，虽然不是那种多台同时工作的壮观场面，但居然还看到了坡地和平地不同型号的;\nGuariroba的采收机，是3个轮子的，有一个轮子负责调控坡度\n‍‍‍‍‍‍\n今天近距离看了下采收车，它很先进哦，有可视化的屏幕以及一些我觉得很高级的设置数字，保证看起来的这个庞然大物，可以非常从容的应对采收任务；果子的收集可以是采收车自己有收集的缓存区，一个小的收集仓，采收完一笼后与卡车会合后卸货给卡车；或者是行进中隔壁就有一量卡车跟着同步行进，采收会有一个传送装置喷射到卡车料斗里；\nNunes在喜拉多地区，大平地，采收车不需要调控角度，4个轮子的\n机械采收除了能开的采收车之外还有手持的设备，没看到实物，这还蛮意外的～\n机械采收和人工采收是配合着来的，有几种情况\n树苗较小，人工手采\n产季初，人工手采掉一些早熟的果子；给后面机械采收做个准备\n特别的区块地型，以及品种本身的特性，或者农场自身的计划，全部人工采收\n产季末，最后一次“清树”，也是人工把零星的一些残留的果子干光\n产季时，机械采收2次，就基本完事了，收尾工作也会很快进行，咖啡树会回到一个一致的状态开始新的一个生产循环\n// 处理方式\n处理方面，这边的处理设备也是非常成熟的，它也保证了对不同情况的鲜果的筛选和筛选后的处理过程的结果的一致和稳定性；\nGuariroba的机械鲜果浮选，有2次的杂质筛选，提升后可以分开来处理好的果子和不好的果子，同时还可以决定是否进行脱皮或者脱皮+脱胶动作\nGuariroba - 鲜果处理，充气有氧过程，这个过程其实也是同时有厌氧发酵在进行的，但是同时给予更多的空气（氧气）可以影响一些需氧和兼性微生菌的活跃和规模\n这几天看到了一些共性的处理方式，正好翻到了18年我当时从网上搜集的信息整理的一篇文章里提到的处理方式，实际执行的时候跟当时网上获得信息有一些出入；\nGuariroba 堆起来发酵\n‍‍‍‍‍‍‍\nGuariroba - 窝堆发酵结束，打开来晾晒\n‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍\nGuaroriba - 晒得差不多了，收起来放入吨袋中静置\n‍‍\nPilar - 吨袋内静置中\n这个处理方式是咖啡鲜果在晒场的晾晒过程，从铺着晒再到窝堆形式的晾晒，堆成一个小山后再可以通过覆盖塑料布实现厌氧+慢干双重效果；然后当果子干燥到一定程度（比如说20-30%含水率）后，将果子转到吨袋中静置，这个静置的过程又会带来厌氧发酵+静置均质的双重作用，在这样的晾晒方式下不同的执行方式/时长阶段会带来不同的风味特征；\nPilar - Static Dryer 干燥后 传送到 Drum Dryer 再干燥，然后再到晒场Patio晾晒，再到吨袋静置\n‍‍‍‍‍\n这种方式前段的干燥还可以在用机械干燥方式再结合中后期的晒场干燥+窝堆+吨袋静置组合干燥的方式带来不同的风味特征产品；\n我们测了一个干果做的批次，哈哈哈～意外的好喝，所以如果你看到网上有人说巴西的干果floaters做的处理啥的，不要惊讶它可能真的会好喝哦～\nNunes -水洗处理设备 Penagos\n‍‍‍‍‍\n还有，鲜果的加工处理上（比如说Pulp Natural或者Honey），这边的设备我看到的几个农场都是用的哥伦Penagos品牌的，询问下来可能的原因是更省水哈哈哈哈，或者说在早些年Penagos比巴西本土的巨头Pinhales的设备更省水，如果要我现在去规划一个处理站，在鲜果 加工设备上我可能也会优先选择Penagos～\n// 修枝\n第一次看到了机械的修枝，没看到过程，看到了结果和机器，大概脑补了一下过程：）\n这种应该叫“整形”式修枝是针对巴西这种咖啡大田的种植密度间距和采收方式整体来考虑的；巴西种植密度，树形的生长方式，间隔式的整，保证了树型不会长的太茂密互相影响日常和通风，同时也可以让树得到喘息，换做其他产区完全复制就不合适了，但这个整体的管理方法可以学习；\nGuariroba～他来了～给咖啡树做物理截肢术了\nGuariroba - 刚修完的结果，像胳膊被从肘部截断一样，地上的残枝会再加入一些用干果皮和土堆好的肥料一起混合起来作为产季后田间管理的一部分\n// 清树\n‍\n‍\n在这边还有一个现象是，产季初和产季末，以及对于刚第一年挂果的地块都会有一个统一的清树动作；我们在云南也有类似的操作，这个操作不光影响当前产季清树后的产出的果子一致性，大田的干净和带来的咖啡树的健康情况，同时对于下一个产季的开花与挂果成熟周期的一致性也有很大的影响；\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\nGuariroba - Paraiso品种地块，第一年产出的区域全部统一清树，而且因为是小树苗，无法做机械采收，全部人工撸串式的采收\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n总结：\n办法总是想出来的，只要你想！取舍！\n下篇预告：\n品种\n科研\n未来",
  "body_html": "<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.578px; white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  有一些内容需要配合小视频可以感受的更直观一些，也第一次用了视频号上传一些视频，没有做啥后期和字幕，大家有啥理解不到位的问题可以评论区留言，我会回复或者集中的问题我会整理集合一个文章再解答哈～\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.578px; white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  因为每一篇文章只能插入10个小视频，所以全部内容会拆分成几篇\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.578px; white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  这次巴西行的内容涉及的的产区，庄园农场合作社和科研机构如下：\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.578px; white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  // Fazenda Guariroba\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.578px; white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  Minas Gerais - Campo das Vertentes - San Antonio do Amparo\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.578px; white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  // Fazenda Santa Clara\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.578px; white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.578px; visibility: visible;\">\n  Minas Gerais - Campo das Vertentes\n  <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px; visibility: visible;\">\n   - San Antonio do Amparo\n  </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.578px; white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  // Coopervass -\n  <span style='letter-spacing: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); visibility: visible;'>\n   Fazenda Pilar\n  </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.578px; white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.578px; visibility: visible;\">\n  Minas Gerais - Mantiqueira -\n  <span style='letter-spacing: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); visibility: visible;'>\n   Natércia\n  </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.578px; white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style='letter-spacing: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); visibility: visible;'>\n  // Expocacer - Fazenda Nunes\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.578px; white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style='letter-spacing: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); visibility: visible;'>\n  Cerrado - Mineiro -\n </span>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); visibility: visible;\">\n  Patrocínio\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.578px; white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style='letter-spacing: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); visibility: visible;'>\n  // Fazenda Minamihara\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.578px; white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style='letter-spacing: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); visibility: visible;'>\n  São Paulo - Alta Mogiana - Franca\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.578px; white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style='letter-spacing: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); visibility: visible;'>\n  // UFLA - Universidad Federal de Lavras\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.578px; white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style='caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.578px; visibility: visible;'>\n  Minas Gerais -\n  <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px; visibility: visible;\">\n   Campo das Vertentes -\n  </span>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: normal; caret-color: rgb(32, 33, 36); color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; visibility: visible;\">\n   Lavras\n  </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.578px; white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n<br style=\"visibility: visible;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.578px; white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<strong style=\"visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n   //采收\n  </span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.578px; white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  上次来只看到了采收机本机，都没看到地里动着的；这回可算看够了，到哪都能看到，虽然不是那种多台同时工作的壮观场面，但居然还看到了坡地和平地不同型号的;\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">\n<mp-common-videosnap class=\"js_uneditable custom_select_card channels_iframe videosnap_video_iframe\" data-authiconurl=\"\" data-desc=\"巴西 机械采收 1\n\nGuariroba\n\n有坡度的地形机械采收\n\n#产区行 #巴西 #FazendaGuariroba #MachineHarvesting #机械采收\" data-errortips=\"\" data-from=\"new\" data-headimgurl=\"http://wx.qlogo.cn/finderhead/VNDQtnw16icL483So2iaR5TC4Zbib5mNdPYQYF58NIgrFuZibJvcj3sgQZBPOMTnhd5uyFvtfZxVRY0/0\" data-height=\"1080\" data-id=\"export/UzFfAgtgekIEAQAAAAAALCAO7XpIIwAAAAstQy6ubaLX4KHWvLEZgBPE4aIEIEITcNiLzNPgMIscTS1ATH_C6k_oV_6BTemy\" data-isdisabled=\"0\" data-mediatype=\"undefined\" data-nickname=\"smallarmsbigheart叨叨\" data-nonceid=\"5587690310171497023\" data-pluginname=\"mpvideosnap\" data-type=\"video\" data-url=\"https://findermp.video.qq.com/251/20350/stodownload?encfilekey=oibeqyX228riaCwo9STVsGLIBn9G5YG8ZnXHezqTmicDeOL7Y6c3BgbSDhkGsrNicXb5Z7obicpfQ778J6L6eT6icN30lXAtXb9Rk1icx8VYZ2Jh7aJTop1JAt1ecEqmibG3ebdjibcea97tiayNs&amp;token=6xykWLEnztJ6qDOXJlRVlvVnCXibyGpoX8HS2icc5XZs8U0TR3h68gT1FWkbC4q0Ov795Vojyvam92E1uXTUrfnVvY8e63pG2HyJusl4BrK5JvWJialgrr0w9E4U2m6GmyS&amp;idx=1&amp;dotrans=0&amp;hy=SZ&amp;m=cce599962cf006d464bbbad20e2759cf\" data-username=\"v2_060000231003b20faec8c7e68b10c5ddcb05ea31b07779e8b249cdfceb5a6a49b19988ba8147@finder\" data-width=\"1920\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">\n</mp-common-videosnap>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; visibility: visible;\">\n<mp-common-videosnap class=\"js_uneditable custom_select_card channels_iframe videosnap_video_iframe\" data-authiconurl=\"\" data-desc=\"巴西 机械采收 2\n\nGuariroba \n\n有坡度的机械采收\n三个轮子的采收车，有一个轮子用来调整30度以内的坡度地形支持\n\n#产区行 #巴西 #机械采收 #FazendaGuariroba\" data-errortips=\"\" data-from=\"new\" data-headimgurl=\"http://wx.qlogo.cn/finderhead/VNDQtnw16icL483So2iaR5TC4Zbib5mNdPYQYF58NIgrFuZibJvcj3sgQZBPOMTnhd5uyFvtfZxVRY0/0\" data-height=\"1080\" data-id=\"export/UzFfAgtgekIEAQAAAAAArlIBqabQNQAAAAstQy6ubaLX4KHWvLEZgBPEkaIEe0F6b9iLzNPgMIscyG8CrueWnjT9ejAhW1W6\" data-isdisabled=\"0\" data-mediatype=\"undefined\" data-nickname=\"smallarmsbigheart叨叨\" data-nonceid=\"9300905952226189922\" data-pluginname=\"mpvideosnap\" data-type=\"video\" data-url=\"https://findermp.video.qq.com/251/20350/stodownload?encfilekey=oibeqyX228riaCwo9STVsGLIBn9G5YG8ZnFBN41apkWibt8ApuQfRcianbZxva7tjQ9rIiaAdZicUxibZbsvC6MTQ7lHMctIicrWlk1JUywOBkx3dTXlmLGKa2icX84nmIMpNmLcnqoR5VIrKnIY&amp;token=cztXnd9GyrGG5dtLfs4kl9NhluNlHqB3Ncpm6GDVPibP57RqakGYT8fPA9Fia0PcHgmosmGao2UeNQfvUsGhUPicK8eL6pxORSjC763kaA6Krjwzol5Ku4x1b3FAT9ciaXAc&amp;idx=1&amp;dotrans=0&amp;hy=SZ&amp;m=5e2f2de1faef8e20c6e04ec852d76365\" data-username=\"v2_060000231003b20faec8c7e68b10c5ddcb05ea31b07779e8b249cdfceb5a6a49b19988ba8147@finder\" data-width=\"1920\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">\n</mp-common-videosnap>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px; visibility: visible;\">\n  Guariroba的采收机，是3个轮子的，有一个轮子负责调控坡度\n </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n  ‍‍‍‍‍‍\n </span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.578px; visibility: visible;\">\n  今天近距离看了下采收车，它很先进哦，有可视化的屏幕以及一些我觉得很高级的设置数字，保证看起来的这个庞然大物，可以非常从容的应对采收任务；果子的收集可以是采收车自己有收集的缓存区，一个小的收集仓，采收完一笼后与卡车会合后卸货给卡车；或者是行进中隔壁就有一量卡车跟着同步行进，采收会有一个传送装置喷射到卡车料斗里；\n </span>\n<br style=\"visibility: visible;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">\n<mp-common-videosnap class=\"js_uneditable custom_select_card channels_iframe videosnap_video_iframe\" data-authiconurl=\"\" data-desc=\"巴西 喜拉多 机械采收\n\nFazenda Nunes\n\n#产区行 #巴西 #喜拉多 #机械采收 #FazendaNunes\" data-errortips=\"\" data-from=\"new\" data-headimgurl=\"http://wx.qlogo.cn/finderhead/VNDQtnw16icL483So2iaR5TC4Zbib5mNdPYQYF58NIgrFuZibJvcj3sgQZBPOMTnhd5uyFvtfZxVRY0/0\" data-height=\"1080\" data-id=\"export/UzFfAgtgekIEAQAAAAAARn0y7cZ-1QAAAAstQy6ubaLX4KHWvLEZgBPElqJsel41b9iLzNPgMIuLZ2xatLYNDXrYjVovr6Tc\" data-isdisabled=\"0\" data-mediatype=\"undefined\" data-nickname=\"smallarmsbigheart叨叨\" data-nonceid=\"4915602710478171436\" data-pluginname=\"mpvideosnap\" data-type=\"video\" data-url=\"https://findermp.video.qq.com/251/20350/stodownload?encfilekey=oibeqyX228riaCwo9STVsGLIBn9G5YG8ZnGenR4Y832L9m85MiaQiaVlD8vtEhtjeiaibaZHy1puD6Smdn43LEDQr6zAYDXGxs4d1uQ6ozt18AdEh4SVUfia4GAaHxicmygwoutsxADEoWuu0uY&amp;token=cztXnd9GyrGG5dtLfs4kl9NhluNlHqB3DF16mgocJkx0tCTjiczzzqibKA3tic5SUeIiccVW3nEt6NSXXl4w2CXCeSPj4ZynsakClxShicaRKcyibm3xhMsA5POQxSFKR42hbL&amp;idx=1&amp;bizid=1023&amp;dotrans=0&amp;hy=SZ&amp;m=615cf9847e3fa81a9740478029bce850&amp;uzid=2\" data-username=\"v2_060000231003b20faec8c7e68b10c5ddcb05ea31b07779e8b249cdfceb5a6a49b19988ba8147@finder\" data-width=\"1920\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">\n</mp-common-videosnap>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; visibility: visible;\">\n<mp-common-videosnap class=\"js_uneditable custom_select_card channels_iframe videosnap_video_iframe\" data-authiconurl=\"\" data-desc=\"巴西 喜拉多 机械采收 2\n\nFazenda Nunes\n\n#产区行 #巴西 #喜拉多 #机械采收 #FazendaNunes\" data-errortips=\"\" data-from=\"new\" data-headimgurl=\"http://wx.qlogo.cn/finderhead/VNDQtnw16icL483So2iaR5TC4Zbib5mNdPYQYF58NIgrFuZibJvcj3sgQZBPOMTnhd5uyFvtfZxVRY0/0\" data-height=\"1080\" data-id=\"export/UzFfAgtgekIEAQAAAAAAve8nLBinqgAAAAstQy6ubaLX4KHWvLEZgBPEzaJ8dHFrZ9iLzNPgMItB0YYRftOxmvcZwVEW5YhS\" data-isdisabled=\"0\" data-mediatype=\"undefined\" data-nickname=\"smallarmsbigheart叨叨\" data-nonceid=\"16638970080153723054\" data-pluginname=\"mpvideosnap\" data-type=\"video\" data-url=\"https://findermp.video.qq.com/251/20350/stodownload?encfilekey=oibeqyX228riaCwo9STVsGLIBn9G5YG8ZnEaQ5ibfhc5XtfJLctZAfub6aBxS1miaHmk2SmvYqLLxUm4KxSCLV0yI71eJrMY78bRqTqmePjSWnQ0LOo4rGQfFZmshiaV2sPQYr46KzOGxOCo&amp;token=cztXnd9GyrGG5dtLfs4kl9NhluNlHqB3blnS9KQaVbw24wt4CGSiaudFq5yr25oj3x7XGaf0McguuWDwv5CjPdkYUibScqWxkJ4ASPDPgKTcQzqhAVBuGJXEpef0F2uTZ0&amp;idx=1&amp;bizid=1023&amp;dotrans=0&amp;hy=SZ&amp;m=410fff33638fd1fdd9437f51a43b8262&amp;uzid=2\" data-username=\"v2_060000231003b20faec8c7e68b10c5ddcb05ea31b07779e8b249cdfceb5a6a49b19988ba8147@finder\" data-width=\"1920\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">\n</mp-common-videosnap>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px; white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px; visibility: visible;\">\n  Nunes在喜拉多地区，大平地，采收车不需要调控角度，4个轮子的\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.578px; white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  机械采收除了能开的采收车之外还有手持的设备，没看到实物，这还蛮意外的～\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.578px; white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  机械采收和人工采收是配合着来的，有几种情况\n </span>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"width: 577.421875px; letter-spacing: 0.578px; white-space: normal; visibility: visible;\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n   树苗较小，人工手采\n  </section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n   产季初，人工手采掉一些早熟的果子；给后面机械采收做个准备\n  </section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n   特别的区块地型，以及品种本身的特性，或者农场自身的计划，全部人工采收\n  </section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n   产季末，最后一次“清树”，也是人工把零星的一些残留的果子干光\n  </section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.578px; white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  产季时，机械采收2次，就基本完事了，收尾工作也会很快进行，咖啡树会回到一个一致的状态开始新的一个生产循环\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.578px; white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n<br style=\"visibility: visible;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.578px; white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<strong style=\"visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n   // 处理方式\n  </span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.578px; white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  处理方面，这边的处理设备也是非常成熟的，它也保证了对不同情况的鲜果的筛选和筛选后的处理过程的结果的一致和稳定性；\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">\n<mp-common-videosnap class=\"js_uneditable custom_select_card channels_iframe videosnap_video_iframe\" data-authiconurl=\"\" data-desc=\"巴西 棕榈树庄园 处理\n鲜果筛选（浮选去除杂质以及分级）\n\nFazenda Guariroba\n\n#产区行 #巴西 #鲜果筛选 #FazendaGuariroba #CherrySelection\" data-errortips=\"\" data-from=\"new\" data-headimgurl=\"http://wx.qlogo.cn/finderhead/VNDQtnw16icL483So2iaR5TC4Zbib5mNdPYQYF58NIgrFuZibJvcj3sgQZBPOMTnhd5uyFvtfZxVRY0/0\" data-height=\"1080\" data-id=\"export/UzFfAgtgekIEAQAAAAAAyCAwSPXPQgAAAAstQy6ubaLX4KHWvLEZgBPE_6IMGgJVbdiLzNPgMIss0UAQNCd4aN9-jUfE7xMl\" data-isdisabled=\"0\" data-mediatype=\"undefined\" data-nickname=\"smallarmsbigheart叨叨\" data-nonceid=\"3749755283671875798\" data-pluginname=\"mpvideosnap\" data-type=\"video\" data-url=\"https://findermp.video.qq.com/251/20350/stodownload?encfilekey=oibeqyX228riaCwo9STVsGLIBn9G5YG8ZnH9cAy5zfsY9ThYdZoS9sDRzTLgWHicxdjEA7a0zFicyC7g0aBKFXM5L4fTdyOrRA5ibgPG0mUremFg2oyFGILseTUcJj5CWa1Udl3nh1GGtFjQ&amp;token=cztXnd9GyrGG5dtLfs4kl9NhluNlHqB3ak4ia6BM2iaBafFLj5y9nrz1eHiab0ynjxOpKWMwPaHPWtLRcYiaA60D8T42tLBRejqLYbFXBEwVWQ8MQ4At1E4qwKX6ibIulK3Rib&amp;idx=1&amp;bizid=1023&amp;dotrans=0&amp;hy=SZ&amp;m=3ab2e706f3eb8057865f9ada6f98fca5&amp;uzid=2\" data-username=\"v2_060000231003b20faec8c7e68b10c5ddcb05ea31b07779e8b249cdfceb5a6a49b19988ba8147@finder\" data-width=\"1920\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">\n</mp-common-videosnap>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; visibility: visible;\">\n<mp-common-videosnap class=\"js_uneditable custom_select_card channels_iframe videosnap_video_iframe\" data-authiconurl=\"\" data-desc=\"巴西 棕榈树庄园 处理\n鲜果筛选（浮选去除杂质以及分级） 2\n\nFazenda Guariroba\n\n#产区行 #巴西 #鲜果筛选 #FazendaGuariroba #CherrySelection\" data-errortips=\"\" data-from=\"new\" data-headimgurl=\"http://wx.qlogo.cn/finderhead/VNDQtnw16icL483So2iaR5TC4Zbib5mNdPYQYF58NIgrFuZibJvcj3sgQZBPOMTnhd5uyFvtfZxVRY0/0\" data-height=\"1080\" data-id=\"export/UzFfAgtgekIEAQAAAAAASzE3l6oG_QAAAAstQy6ubaLX4KHWvLEZgBPEyqIUOi1MYtiLzNPgMIsW6MoHFuTZfjtZj_u5Tq37\" data-isdisabled=\"0\" data-mediatype=\"undefined\" data-nickname=\"smallarmsbigheart叨叨\" data-nonceid=\"9838852202499905156\" data-pluginname=\"mpvideosnap\" data-type=\"video\" data-url=\"https://findermp.video.qq.com/251/20350/stodownload?encfilekey=oibeqyX228riaCwo9STVsGLIBn9G5YG8Znjjzicq3ggMiclyNsicpqBdv5rRkQkXggOKibt8z1DH3ZGfe2anCUe8hwjibKm6shG4sHiar6IuVEwA5s3KibJwNcncsCM2wzFGtnx6UUwSzqibf1mts&amp;token=cztXnd9GyrGG5dtLfs4kl9NhluNlHqB3wLUVPyDYS9MIOtS2WltQiaKd0pW2lwCFia5MkIMdd3vStvREtjt8G2sJXpyeicmtRdXS8u3G696xk85K1dlEQibaEne4cgHzgXia8&amp;idx=1&amp;bizid=1023&amp;dotrans=0&amp;hy=SZ&amp;m=e6ef39670fa61973d19d1680b53112b6&amp;uzid=2\" data-username=\"v2_060000231003b20faec8c7e68b10c5ddcb05ea31b07779e8b249cdfceb5a6a49b19988ba8147@finder\" data-width=\"1920\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">\n</mp-common-videosnap>\n</section>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px; white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; margin-bottom: 0px; text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px; font-size: 12px; visibility: visible;\">\n  Guariroba的机械鲜果浮选，有2次的杂质筛选，提升后可以分开来处理好的果子和不好的果子，同时还可以决定是否进行脱皮或者脱皮+脱胶动作\n </span>\n<br style=\"visibility: visible;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">\n<br style=\"visibility: visible;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; visibility: visible;\">\n<mp-common-videosnap class=\"js_uneditable custom_select_card channels_iframe videosnap_video_iframe\" data-authiconurl=\"\" data-desc=\"巴西 棕榈树庄园\n发酵处理 - 有氧过程\nFazenda Guariroba\n\n#产区行 #巴西 #棕榈树庄园 #加工处理 #有氧过程 #FazendaGuariroba #Aerobic\" data-errortips=\"\" data-from=\"new\" data-headimgurl=\"http://wx.qlogo.cn/finderhead/VNDQtnw16icL483So2iaR5TC4Zbib5mNdPYQYF58NIgrFuZibJvcj3sgQZBPOMTnhd5uyFvtfZxVRY0/0\" data-height=\"1080\" data-id=\"export/UzFfAgtgekIEAQAAAAAAXQ4KR2mFvgAAAAstQy6ubaLX4KHWvLEZgBPEzqIwICBCGdiLzNPgMIuZxg-OsSDRmDJjg7uGJis4\" data-isdisabled=\"0\" data-mediatype=\"undefined\" data-nickname=\"smallarmsbigheart叨叨\" data-nonceid=\"4653032881939361091\" data-pluginname=\"mpvideosnap\" data-type=\"video\" data-url=\"https://findermp.video.qq.com/251/20350/stodownload?encfilekey=oibeqyX228riaCwo9STVsGLIBn9G5YG8ZnuEwqBNyia9dBMl960vKxjcxu0Dt8C5cqRLjBInDeXsF6TrjSby3S6VL4QOkEuruibksuhXCuJup6DJ5VQELQPBqS1Fiah4oIj23ydlIdJe9VfE&amp;token=cztXnd9GyrGG5dtLfs4kl9NhluNlHqB3FmFezuhMicSvp0pLzuuO7F6qpd5UQ5dX5SURck9yeHA4k5aA7fhK4GL8JibBBjSKSKAib8iaomBJL2hgcbz4a2yKxA0W0QpWlaOT&amp;idx=1&amp;dotrans=0&amp;hy=SZ&amp;m=a94f197f0e0c753137a5bd308261bec5\" data-username=\"v2_060000231003b20faec8c7e68b10c5ddcb05ea31b07779e8b249cdfceb5a6a49b19988ba8147@finder\" data-width=\"1920\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">\n</mp-common-videosnap>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px; visibility: visible;\">\n  Guariroba - 鲜果处理，充气有氧过程，这个过程其实也是同时有厌氧发酵在进行的，但是同时给予更多的空气（氧气）可以影响一些需氧和兼性微生菌的活跃和规模\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.578px; white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.578px; visibility: visible;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.578px; white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.578px; visibility: visible;\">\n<br style=\"visibility: visible;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.578px; white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.578px; visibility: visible;\">\n  这几天看到了一些共性的处理方式，正好翻到了18年我当时从网上搜集的信息整理的一篇文章里提到的处理方式，实际执行的时候跟当时网上获得信息有一些出入；\n </span>\n<br style=\"visibility: visible;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; visibility: visible;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7R4bHptvxEZxnNVvMQl5V93NwZtayGuQESJ4ibUl8oVG4kPzLCBVibYibibc3GibWoBmyySb9fPgicDGOjA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\" style=\"aspect-ratio: calc(1.333333) / 1; width: 680px !important; height: auto !important; visibility: visible;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n  Guariroba 堆起来发酵\n </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n  ‍‍‍‍‍‍‍\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7R4bHptvxEZxnNVvMQl5V93yu5ica2cbyrbibldAkMwiakxibYwzibBbOib8NWnBmuBic0gujWKy0ASAOp0Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\" style=\"aspect-ratio: calc(1.333333) / 1; width: 680px !important; height: auto !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n  Guariroba - 窝堆发酵结束，打开来晾晒\n </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n  ‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7R4bHptvxEZxnNVvMQl5V93N07p6MNYIRJzfYRaTbTGAdHNZkibW1m8E3XLz4Kg9OEBIAkvcwiaH9CQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\" style=\"aspect-ratio: calc(1.333333) / 1; width: 680px !important; height: auto !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n  Guaroriba - 晒得差不多了，收起来放入吨袋中静置\n </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n  ‍‍\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7R4bHptvxEZxnNVvMQl5V93iaay5MpnDWvhLsA7OX4jKBXgybyiaux4l6RmqE7O8ibDDOGib3B4CFmP2g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\" style=\"aspect-ratio: calc(1.333333) / 1; width: 680px !important; height: auto !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style='caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: left;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 12px;'>\n  Pilar - 吨袋内静置中\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  这个处理方式是咖啡鲜果在晒场的晾晒过程，从铺着晒再到窝堆形式的晾晒，堆成一个小山后再可以通过覆盖塑料布实现厌氧+慢干双重效果；然后当果子干燥到一定程度（比如说20-30%含水率）后，将果子转到吨袋中静置，这个静置的过程又会带来厌氧发酵+静置均质的双重作用，在这样的晾晒方式下不同的执行方式/时长阶段会带来不同的风味特征；\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<mp-common-videosnap class=\"js_uneditable custom_select_card channels_iframe videosnap_video_iframe\" data-authiconurl=\"\" data-desc=\"巴西 合作社\n机械干燥\nStatic 干燥床 + 滚筒式干燥组合 + 晒场干燥 + 吨袋内静置 \n\n#产区行 #巴西 #机械干燥 #合作社 #Coopervass #MechincalDrying #StaticDryer #DryDryer\" data-errortips=\"\" data-from=\"new\" data-headimgurl=\"http://wx.qlogo.cn/finderhead/VNDQtnw16icL483So2iaR5TC4Zbib5mNdPYQYF58NIgrFuZibJvcj3sgQZBPOMTnhd5uyFvtfZxVRY0/0\" data-height=\"1080\" data-id=\"export/UzFfAgtgekIEAQAAAAAAl60FtbV7YAAAAAstQy6ubaLX4KHWvLEZgBPE4aI0K1YlHNiLzNPgMIsOnnRns0_TRsKWBly6kWkG\" data-isdisabled=\"0\" data-mediatype=\"undefined\" data-nickname=\"smallarmsbigheart叨叨\" data-nonceid=\"1386810382569427915\" data-pluginname=\"mpvideosnap\" data-type=\"video\" data-url=\"https://findermp.video.qq.com/251/20350/stodownload?encfilekey=oibeqyX228riaCwo9STVsGLIBn9G5YG8ZnlqgW0y9FNScp8WBSNsaAzQRCBmjNX9ib8UQofqibwVftcEEtHliafEpCr4lvJ8e7wpib5rnCibVmOLPrKJ8yKh5oByyyux6bnAOUuGCibrKmiaUk7g&amp;token=cztXnd9GyrGG5dtLfs4kl9NhluNlHqB3RxEdCITKJuQ1OzRhQTwuawAbCiaibNVsoAb0sTLExGMqEIhFKsMTdS1RrEyO6V0M251VUYXKsbD4jm633Ovww1WicV7EpcWhNqq&amp;idx=1&amp;bizid=1023&amp;dotrans=0&amp;hy=SZ&amp;m=99b6b7b58f02712c413a2a7cef5a7fd3&amp;uzid=2\" data-username=\"v2_060000231003b20faec8c7e68b10c5ddcb05ea31b07779e8b249cdfceb5a6a49b19988ba8147@finder\" data-width=\"1920\">\n</mp-common-videosnap>\n</section>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;text-align: center;\">\n<span style='caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 12px;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: left;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n  Pilar - Static Dryer 干燥后 传送到 Drum Dryer 再干燥，然后再到晒场Patio晾晒，再到吨袋静置\n  <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n   ‍‍‍‍‍\n  </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  这种方式前段的干燥还可以在用机械干燥方式再结合中后期的晒场干燥+窝堆+吨袋静置组合干燥的方式带来不同的风味特征产品；\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  我们测了一个干果做的批次，哈哈哈～意外的好喝，所以如果你看到网上有人说巴西的干果floaters做的处理啥的，不要惊讶它可能真的会好喝哦～\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QBW0VaPXemepaGtAxaLXey8kSwmfdLKvT3A5O3Em4k4T6rbH50hjlNFQ5GPobxibQSjnI53pib4alA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\" style=\"aspect-ratio: calc(1.333333) / 1; width: 680px !important; height: auto !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n  Nunes -水洗处理设备 Penagos\n </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n  ‍‍‍‍‍\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  还有，鲜果的加工处理上（比如说Pulp Natural或者Honey），这边的设备我看到的几个农场都是用的哥伦Penagos品牌的，询问下来可能的原因是更省水哈哈哈哈，或者说在早些年Penagos比巴西本土的巨头Pinhales的设备更省水，如果要我现在去规划一个处理站，在鲜果 加工设备上我可能也会优先选择Penagos～\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  // 修枝\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  第一次看到了机械的修枝，没看到过程，看到了结果和机器，大概脑补了一下过程：）\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  这种应该叫“整形”式修枝是针对巴西这种咖啡大田的种植密度间距和采收方式整体来考虑的；巴西种植密度，树形的生长方式，间隔式的整，保证了树型不会长的太茂密互相影响日常和通风，同时也可以让树得到喘息，换做其他产区完全复制就不合适了，但这个整体的管理方法可以学习；\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Tox6Vsa37TxOK9Z8AfaR4GGGFT9W5jGxbFr61L8Oo2UXHATcNPAtn1waAte2DNvltTDwNcYnXJrQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\" style=\"aspect-ratio: calc(1.333333) / 1; width: 680px !important; height: auto !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  Guariroba～他来了～给咖啡树做物理截肢术了\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<mp-common-videosnap class=\"js_uneditable custom_select_card channels_iframe videosnap_video_iframe\" data-authiconurl=\"\" data-desc=\"巴西 产季后农务 （整形式）修枝 \n\nGuariroba \nSkeleton pruning\n\n#产区行 #巴西 #FazendaGuariroba #SkeletonPruning #修枝\" data-errortips=\"\" data-from=\"new\" data-headimgurl=\"http://wx.qlogo.cn/finderhead/VNDQtnw16icL483So2iaR5TC4Zbib5mNdPYQYF58NIgrFuZibJvcj3sgQZBPOMTnhd5uyFvtfZxVRY0/0\" data-height=\"1080\" data-id=\"export/UzFfAgtgekIEAQAAAAAAnygvZo-KLwAAAAstQy6ubaLX4KHWvLEZgBPE66I0RHI0RNiLzNPgMIv2ozHnTHny15SZACjnbA4h\" data-isdisabled=\"0\" data-mediatype=\"undefined\" data-nickname=\"smallarmsbigheart叨叨\" data-nonceid=\"5782972386752940556\" data-pluginname=\"mpvideosnap\" data-type=\"video\" data-url=\"https://findermp.video.qq.com/251/20350/stodownload?encfilekey=oibeqyX228riaCwo9STVsGLIBn9G5YG8ZnUu9EkYDibt72b0OMoaZeUK5F4pXN0I1MaFyC2zicPTGRNHGPhibUqPNJCbcNGvcNRW3QS5ibN0rmOTLfypYzLAREZGQTh8Gbszlibr6lWyriakssw&amp;token=6xykWLEnztJ6qDOXJlRVlvVnCXibyGpoXO6NAS8BPa3ySpW3Qdib6qUPWBbeFWSibeboWdiaHPtAI63rEE6e3UpgrZJggHliajZr5fO22LgkQ6URYxhgsy0T9aM3Yn0Kszvl0&amp;idx=1&amp;bizid=1023&amp;dotrans=0&amp;hy=SZ&amp;m=5be6a4eba3ab1225d788992d542b2ee8&amp;uzid=2\" data-username=\"v2_060000231003b20faec8c7e68b10c5ddcb05ea31b07779e8b249cdfceb5a6a49b19988ba8147@finder\" data-width=\"1920\">\n</mp-common-videosnap>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<mp-common-videosnap class=\"js_uneditable custom_select_card channels_iframe videosnap_video_iframe\" data-authiconurl=\"\" data-desc=\"巴西 产季后农务 修枝\n整形式修枝\n\nFazenda Guariroba\n\n#产区行 #巴西 #修枝 #FazendaGuariroba #SkeletonPruning\" data-errortips=\"\" data-from=\"new\" data-headimgurl=\"http://wx.qlogo.cn/finderhead/VNDQtnw16icL483So2iaR5TC4Zbib5mNdPYQYF58NIgrFuZibJvcj3sgQZBPOMTnhd5uyFvtfZxVRY0/0\" data-height=\"1080\" data-id=\"export/UzFfAgtgekIEAQAAAAAAb00W46sKUAAAAAstQy6ubaLX4KHWvLEZgBPEz6IcE2VebNiLzNPgMIts-IZbNeuG7J5y8StusFsX\" data-isdisabled=\"0\" data-mediatype=\"undefined\" data-nickname=\"smallarmsbigheart叨叨\" data-nonceid=\"16204147744318966731\" data-pluginname=\"mpvideosnap\" data-type=\"video\" data-url=\"https://findermp.video.qq.com/251/20350/stodownload?encfilekey=oibeqyX228riaCwo9STVsGLIBn9G5YG8ZnXIgGBnGKAks4DYyVGju9sFKXjicNfNgWICLW95lx4enBmgueOY2BXibgpmUYiauXd5syOSicgf9XFNpria9fNZNVs85poM25QSotEjeUtvOMzT5w&amp;token=6xykWLEnztJ6qDOXJlRVlvVnCXibyGpoXvibtKwbwQ08X4CXDuxTia8OtAmibeLrUmZfG6PqIMMBOTVyxVIU4Ub53MpwdWf8lgOY8Kcv6vCy1aw6GZg4desqOQbMQAyrUKHN&amp;idx=1&amp;bizid=1023&amp;dotrans=0&amp;hy=SZ&amp;m=8fc61bf51b640e7ca88381428cf0b55d&amp;uzid=2\" data-username=\"v2_060000231003b20faec8c7e68b10c5ddcb05ea31b07779e8b249cdfceb5a6a49b19988ba8147@finder\" data-width=\"1920\">\n</mp-common-videosnap>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n  Guariroba - 刚修完的结果，像胳膊被从肘部截断一样，地上的残枝会再加入一些用干果皮和土堆好的肥料一起混合起来作为产季后田间管理的一部分\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  // 清树\n  <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n   ‍\n  </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n   ‍\n  </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  在这边还有一个现象是，产季初和产季末，以及对于刚第一年挂果的地块都会有一个统一的清树动作；我们在云南也有类似的操作，这个操作不光影响当前产季清树后的产出的果子一致性，大田的干净和带来的咖啡树的健康情况，同时对于下一个产季的开花与挂果成熟周期的一致性也有很大的影响；\n  <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n   ‍\n  </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n   ‍\n  </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n   ‍\n  </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n   ‍\n  </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n   ‍\n  </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n   ‍\n  </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n   ‍\n  </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n   ‍\n  </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n   ‍\n  </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n   ‍\n  </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n   ‍\n  </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n   ‍\n  </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n   ‍\n  </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n   ‍\n  </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n   ‍\n  </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n   ‍\n  </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7R4bHptvxEZxnNVvMQl5V933C1hZiaUVglDpX2bAXzGzaNRnQiab79HaYRFRvFKB4ukpr7S4K6YXzYQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\" style=\"aspect-ratio: calc(1.333333) / 1; width: 680px !important; height: auto !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n  Guariroba - Paraiso品种地块，第一年产出的区域全部统一清树，而且因为是小树苗，无法做机械采收，全部人工撸串式的采收\n </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n  ‍\n </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n  ‍\n </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n  ‍\n </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n  ‍\n </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n  ‍\n </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n  ‍\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  总结：\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  办法总是想出来的，只要你想！取舍！\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  下篇预告：\n </span>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n     品种\n    </span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n     科研\n    </span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n     未来\n    </span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>",
